This is the permanently accepted Atlantis Shield Controller table model baseline.
Do not change its geometry, textures, crystals, legs, joint panels, display, or hologram layout unless the user explicitly requests a table-model change.
The user-requested leg changes convert each twelve-segment diagonal beam into one continuous tapered mesh, yaw its cross-section to match the mirrored ±22.5-degree foot angles, remove the two obsolete stepped lower joint caps, and bury each leg's horizontal end cap inside its foot so only continuous side faces emerge at the existing connection point. The tabletop, feet, upper mounts, controls, and all other 87 JSON elements are unchanged.
